{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lysward is in development, and we\u2019re excited to share the journey with you. Wishlist now to stay updated on the latest improvements.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lysward, you awaken as Kiran, a fugitive experiment with no memory beyond a single name: Orren. Stranded in a desert where the sun never sets, survival means mastering both the relentless environment and the secrets buried within it. But don\u2019t worry: survival isn't a path you'll walk alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/9765719f64b01aa4c661d74f1e843ae8.avif?t=1758291976\" width=723 height=194 /></span><br>Umbra is a tidally locked world split between perpetual daylight and eternal darkness. Your story unfolds on Zenit, where the sun always shines, and its light generates Amri, a potent magical resource that empowers you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must navigate this treacherous desert where the sun\u2019s relentless heat can defeat you quickly. Manage your hunger and thirst, and learn how to avoid overheating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/0ea1efae0533970e41dac63a9e37c992.poster.avif?t=1758291976\" width=898 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/0ea1efae0533970e41dac63a9e37c992.webm?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in Lysward depends on your resourcefulness. Scavenge for resources, craft vital tools and equipment, and carefully manage your inventory, with items of varying sizes and shapes. Every decision counts in this unforgiving environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/962f869135fdbf33d7077858b11247d9.poster.avif?t=1758291976\" width=898 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/962f869135fdbf33d7077858b11247d9.webm?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The energy flowing through your Amri device is more than just a tool\u2014it\u2019s the key to your survival. Master its power to overcome the challenges of this unforgiving world. Whether you\u2019re facing scorching heat, treacherous terrain, or mysterious foes, the Amri magic will be your greatest ally. But beware: only those who truly understand its potential will thrive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first ability, Tremor, lets you shatter boulders, collect resources from a distance, and deal with dangerous creatures.<br> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/fbd98f6b869ca657381bb328df63ec81.poster.avif?t=1758291976\" width=898 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/fbd98f6b869ca657381bb328df63ec81.webm?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/fbd98f6b869ca657381bb328df63ec81.mp4?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you rise to the challenge and unlock the secrets of the Amri, good things will be at the wave of your hand.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your second ability is one of life: Grow trees for crucial resources and purify contaminated water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/05e8ae6f368ee4e6250d51387cf6a7e9.poster.avif?t=1758291976\" width=898 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/05e8ae6f368ee4e6250d51387cf6a7e9.webm?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/05e8ae6f368ee4e6250d51387cf6a7e9.mp4?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You won\u2019t face the desert alone. At your side is Gjorna, your mentor and companion, and just as lost in some ways as you. Like you, she\u2019s searching for answers and a way out. Together, you\u2019ll battle the unforgiving desert and uncover the hidden truths buried beneath its endless sands. With her expertise, you can research the items you find together to develop new crafting recipes and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/ced1b229d4e176170fe85f3e8d388bcb.poster.avif?t=1758291976\" width=898 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/ced1b229d4e176170fe85f3e8d388bcb.webm?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The desert is alive with strange creatures roaming the sands. Some are friendly, offering resources, while others will attack. Learn their behaviors and adapt your strategies to survive encounters with the desert\u2019s inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/f466afeb924be3bf650a42ba7899af72.avif?t=1758291976\" width=723 height=194 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2994600?t=1758291976","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758291976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/42d3d53b54cd77ab52f1ddf44fd3624899acc216/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758291976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/42d3d53b54cd77ab52f1ddf44fd3624899acc216/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758291976","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lysward is in development, and we\u2019re excited to share the journey with you. Wishlist now to stay updated on the latest improvements.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lysward, you awaken as Kiran, a fugitive experiment with no memory beyond a single name: Orren. Stranded in a desert where the sun never sets, survival means mastering both the relentless environment and the secrets buried within it. But don\u2019t worry: survival isn't a path you'll walk alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/9765719f64b01aa4c661d74f1e843ae8.avif?t=1758291976\" width=723 height=194 /></span><br>Umbra is a tidally locked world split between perpetual daylight and eternal darkness. Your story unfolds on Zenit, where the sun always shines, and its light generates Amri, a potent magical resource that empowers you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must navigate this treacherous desert where the sun\u2019s relentless heat can defeat you quickly. Manage your hunger and thirst, and learn how to avoid overheating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/0ea1efae0533970e41dac63a9e37c992.poster.avif?t=1758291976\" width=898 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/0ea1efae0533970e41dac63a9e37c992.webm?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in Lysward depends on your resourcefulness. Scavenge for resources, craft vital tools and equipment, and carefully manage your inventory, with items of varying sizes and shapes. Every decision counts in this unforgiving environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/962f869135fdbf33d7077858b11247d9.poster.avif?t=1758291976\" width=898 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/962f869135fdbf33d7077858b11247d9.webm?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The energy flowing through your Amri device is more than just a tool\u2014it\u2019s the key to your survival. Master its power to overcome the challenges of this unforgiving world. Whether you\u2019re facing scorching heat, treacherous terrain, or mysterious foes, the Amri magic will be your greatest ally. But beware: only those who truly understand its potential will thrive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first ability, Tremor, lets you shatter boulders, collect resources from a distance, and deal with dangerous creatures.<br> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/fbd98f6b869ca657381bb328df63ec81.poster.avif?t=1758291976\" width=898 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/fbd98f6b869ca657381bb328df63ec81.webm?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/fbd98f6b869ca657381bb328df63ec81.mp4?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>If you rise to the challenge and unlock the secrets of the Amri, good things will be at the wave of your hand.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your second ability is one of life: Grow trees for crucial resources and purify contaminated water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/05e8ae6f368ee4e6250d51387cf6a7e9.poster.avif?t=1758291976\" width=898 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/05e8ae6f368ee4e6250d51387cf6a7e9.webm?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/05e8ae6f368ee4e6250d51387cf6a7e9.mp4?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You won\u2019t face the desert alone. At your side is Gjorna, your mentor and companion, and just as lost in some ways as you. Like you, she\u2019s searching for answers and a way out. Together, you\u2019ll battle the unforgiving desert and uncover the hidden truths buried beneath its endless sands. With her expertise, you can research the items you find together to develop new crafting recipes and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/ced1b229d4e176170fe85f3e8d388bcb.poster.avif?t=1758291976\" width=898 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/ced1b229d4e176170fe85f3e8d388bcb.webm?t=1758291976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The desert is alive with strange creatures roaming the sands. Some are friendly, offering resources, while others will attack. Learn their behaviors and adapt your strategies to survive encounters with the desert\u2019s inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/extras/f466afeb924be3bf650a42ba7899af72.avif?t=1758291976\" width=723 height=194 /></span></p>","developers":["Snowcastle Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994600/02ddd9ade7dc11f39bad0cb78d509a3e18812c14/header.jpg?t=1758291976","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2994600/832271/c57c02b01e51380382a088bc7f77eefa1c83065e/1750956244/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741889855","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2994600/832271/c57c02b01e51380382a088bc7f77eefa1c83065e/1750956244/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741889855","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2994600/832271/c57c02b01e51380382a088bc7f77eefa1c83065e/1750956244/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1741889855","id":257100357,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100357/movie480.mp4?t=1741889855","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100357/movie_max.mp4?t=1741889855"},"name":"Lysward - Official Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100357/647ed3a561556056c7633fbf2506395247136efe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741889855","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.co